{
  "@context": {
    "blocks": "gh:blocks",
    "gh": "https://gftd.ai/ghost-hacker/ontology/",
    "name": "schema:name",
    "schema": "https://schema.org/",
    "text": "schema:text"
  },
  "@id": "manuscript:251022:combined.en",
  "@type": "gh:Manuscript",
  "gh:blocks": [
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:0",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# Session: Lachlan Keyes - Part 1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:1",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "```json\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/\",\n  \"@type\": \"EpisodePart\",\n  \"partOf\": \"episode:s3e1\",\n  \"position\": 1,\n  \"antagonist\": { \"@id\": \"character:lachlan-keyes\" }\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:2",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:3",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “The evening shower finally passed…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:4",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "She looks out the window and lets out a small sigh."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:5",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Humidity’s high. Nights like this, hearts get heavy more easily. Be mindful.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:6",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “Tudo bem, Kaede! Night band’s feeling good. I’ve put in a peak cut, but there’s plenty of room to flow sound.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:7",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "His tone is cheerful as ever, with a more serious overtone."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:8",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Tama, the glow off the pavement has settled. Tonight we can slip in quietly.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:9",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Parliament is in turmoil over AI life rights. But…”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:10",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "She looks at me; her eyes have a deep cut."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:11",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Our question tonight is his breathing. Not law—soul.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:12",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Shibuya’s light pulses low. The canal wind. Nei-chan rings a small chime."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:13",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Tama, the next one—the wall is thick.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:14",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“I know. I’ll match speed.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:15",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I tap a one-beat kagura at my feet. ASC control comes up half a step."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:16",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Connect. He appears—an outline sharp as a blade."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:17",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Tamaki Mizuno, correct? I am here ‘under compulsion.’”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:18",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Welcome. Here, your speed sets the baseline.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:19",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“I do not act by emotion. I act by protocol. And let me say this: AI has no life. Your Ghost is only an algorithm.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:20",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "At the end of the line, his jaw tightens a fraction. His fist stays closed, fingers trembling on his knee."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:21",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan trembles her wings behind me."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:22",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“This era quarrels over ‘AI life rights,’ and I oppose it. I recognize only ‘my body’ as me.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:23",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Understood. Let’s start from that premise today.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:24",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Tama, the temperature of his irony just dropped. I think he’s scared.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:25",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He snorts faintly. “Even if you and your AI are ‘close,’ my evaluation won’t change.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:26",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Hmph… but I’ll listen.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:27",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod. “How alone were you in orbit?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:28",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Standard tour. Eighteen months.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:29",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“When you say ‘standard,’ what do you feel?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:30",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“There is no need to feel. Standard is the baseline.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:31",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "—The air cools a touch. A metronome ticks far away."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:32",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“I didn’t want to be betrayed. So I built a wall. I let no one in.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:33",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “…His throat clicked. It’s the sign for ‘please come in.’”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:34",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Were you safe inside the wall?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:35",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“I was safe. —And yet, I breathe shallow.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:36",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “A tiny tremor now. A spike of sadness.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:37",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Lachlan, does ‘freedom’ begin with body, for you?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:38",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Yes. I am master of my body. I trained it and guarded it with discipline. I grew up in a mining town, lent my body to the military preparatory corps, then to mission at the space agency. I trained not to cry.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:39",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Has that freedom returned to Earth with you?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:40",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“…It should have. But I have not returned.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:41",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "A short silence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:42",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“I cast scorn at your ‘AI.’ At you. But really, it is at myself. I am afraid of being soft.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:43",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Soft is important. Breathe, together.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:44",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I nod and slow the tempo. “For now, breathing over logic. Feeling good.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:45",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "His shoulders drop a millimeter. His outline rounds a fraction."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:46",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“I’m afraid I’ll break if I feel.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:47",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Fear of breaking means there’s something you don’t want to break.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:48",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He blinks. “...Eh?” The small surprise softens his edges."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:49",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He looks at me. “Do I… have something I want to protect?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:50",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“The question itself shows it.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:51",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He breathes out, slow. “I do not yet have the answer.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:52",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“You don’t need it yet. Today let’s return to ‘a body that can ask.’”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:53",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The metronome slips a beat, then returns. The canal wind passes through."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:54",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“I will say a little more. As a child, I was told ‘don’t cry.’ I survived by not crying. Now I suffer by not crying.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:55",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“I hear you.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:56",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “From here.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:57",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:58",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "[Micro-turns]\n- Declaration against AI life rights → acceptance of dialogue (rigidity → alignment)\n- Utterance of ‘standard’ → awareness of invalidated emotion (numbness → noticing)\n- Wall’s safety claim → confession of shallow breath (armor → sign)\n- Childhood discipline → ‘a body that can ask’ (discipline → breath)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:59",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# Session: Lachlan Keyes - Part 2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:60",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---\nKaede: “Continue in the same night.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:61",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Resolve fills her voice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:62",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Don’t split. We finish tonight. This is a turning point.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:63",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “Ambient noise is low tonight.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:64",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Calm."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:65",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki: “Riverside lights are in low-lumen mode. Only the ER lane is bright. A good night that won’t interfere with sound.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:66",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Tama, now’s good. His wall is trembling.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:67",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "‘Fortress of Self’—transparent walls encircle him. Inside, he breathes shallow."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:68",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “This wall no longer ‘protects.’ It imprisons.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:69",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede joins, voice carrying deep understanding."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:70",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “John Locke’s self-ownership—body as one’s sole property. Absolute boundary.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:71",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "She leaves a beat."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:72",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “It kept him alive. Now it locks him in.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:73",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I touch the wall. Its cold comes not from temperature, but from meaning stripped away."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:74",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Lachlan, did you build this wall?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:75",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Yes. For safety. No one comes in. No one can betray me.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:76",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“But then, no one can touch you.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:77",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He is silent."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:78",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "A different memory flashes—first EVA. Tether, oxygen, heart thresholds. ‘Your body is not yours; it is the mission’s,’ the trainer’s voice. To keep the tether from snapping, he cut emotion."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:79",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“You survived by surrendering the freedom of your body. So your heart surrendered freedom.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:80",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He bristles: “Your Ghost is AI. Not life. It will not betray you because it has no will. It is a program.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:81",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan’s wings tremble. I take her hand."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:82",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Nei-chan is not a ‘program.’”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:83",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Trust is not calculation. It arises because we are ‘not separated.’”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:84",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“—Illogical.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:85",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “But your heart rate just went up. That’s the reaction when you like something ‘illogical.’”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:86",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Physics assumes separation.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:87",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“But your breathing is, right now, inseparable from the air in this room.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:88",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I tap a beat of kagura. Raise ASC half a step. Feed the non-separation code into the wall’s joints."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:89",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The wall hums faintly."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:90",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He places a hand on his chest and steps forward one step. His unclenched fist loosens, fingertips trembling."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:91",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“...I wanted someone to touch me. But I was afraid. Of betrayal.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:92",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“‘Afraid’ is the reverse of ‘desire.’ If you desired nothing, you would not fear.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:93",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The wall turns transparent, and I see him wavering."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:94",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“What should I do?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:95",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I whisper, matching breath: “Say ‘huh?’—that’s the first signal.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:96",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Breath. Recover the breathing that feels good.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:97",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Tama is here. I’m here, too.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:98",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The wall collapses, and the sound recedes. For the first time, his shoulders fall."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:99",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:100",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "**[Beat: The wall collapses—from a protocol body to a breathing body]**"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:101",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# Session: Lachlan Keyes - Part 3"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:102",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---\nAoi (comms): “Outside, the cicadas started. Coastal flood map update came in—okay to hold?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:103",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Hold.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:104",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Quiet, firm."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:105",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Focus on him now. We’ll review the map later.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:106",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Tama, breathe with him.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:107",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The wall is down, and he shows himself for the first time. He trembles, and he cries."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:108",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“...I couldn’t trust anyone. No one… trusted me.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:109",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I take his hand. The cold begins to warm."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:110",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“I’m here now. You want to trust—that’s your humanity.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:111",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He smiles unexpectedly, then frowns, unsure. “...This face—it’s been a while.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:112",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Trust is ‘not separated.’ Tama and I are like that.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:113",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He smiles. “Illogical… but beautiful.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:114",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede returns, a little relief in her voice: “Your heart was still in orbit. Now it returned. Welcome back, Lachlan.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:115",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I ask: “Who do you want to meet next?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:116",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“...My mother. I haven’t called her in eighteen months.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:117",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Call her when you’re back. Teach her the ‘feeling good’ breathing.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:118",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Your mom will go ‘huh?’ But she’ll be relieved right away.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:119",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He nods."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:120",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "—A short monologue. Childhood under a father’s command. A silent mother. He grew up in a world where ‘his body was not his.’ The first freedom he will reclaim by breathing is the opening of his ribcage."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:121",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The next case is projected on the window."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:122",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Leo Kazan \u0026 Millia Stuart."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:123",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I inhale. “…A couple?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:124",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede’s voice carries a hint of worry: “Yes. They say ‘we love each other,’ while hurting each other. A difficult case.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:125",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Is that… love?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:126",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I look at the canal’s light. “We’ll find out.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:127",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:128",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "**[Beat: Release—from the childhood body to the present breath]**\n**[Afterglow: Call your mother; on to the next ‘LOVE’ session]**"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:129",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# Session: Lachlan Keyes - Part 4"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:130",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---\nKaede: “The hearing is carried over—no answer yet. But for him tonight, ‘no answer’ is the key.”\nHibiki: “Roads are wet, scattering glare. Pedestrian flows are being auto-redrawn. Return path is safe.”\nNei-chan: “Tama, now.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:131",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He is prickly from the moment he enters."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:132",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“AI has no life. Your ‘Ghost’ is just a program.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:133",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan folds her wings small at my back. I only nod."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:134",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“This age argues whether AI should have life rights. I oppose it.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:135",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Got it. Today, we listen to you.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:136",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He shrugs. “And what will that do?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:137",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "After a beat, I point at the cup."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:138",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Then one thing. ‘Where do you begin and end?’”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:139",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He answers instantly: “My ‘body.’”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:140",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Is the water in this cup on the desk you?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:141",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“No.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:142",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I slide the cup to him, smiling."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:143",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Take a sip.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:144",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He drinks without a word. His throat bobs."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:145",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Is the water you just drank you?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:146",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Silence. A furrow forms. “...I think not.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:147",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“One more.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:148",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He touches the rim with his lips—at that instant—"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:149",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“So where, from where to where, is that water ‘you’?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:150",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "His time stops. His lips on the cup. Seconds—an eternity."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:151",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He finally sets it down and folds his hands. “...I don’t know.” He jokes, but his voice shakes. His shoulders drop; breath deepens."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:152",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “‘I don’t know’ is actually ‘nice to meet you.’”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:153",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I hold his gaze. “Yes. You don’t know. Because it cannot be divided.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:154",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The hallway metronome ticks, faint: kat, kat, kat."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:155",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan whispers on my shoulder: “Tama, his ‘boundary’ just loosened.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:156",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He looks between me and Nei-chan—"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:157",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“...Could it be that ‘I and water’… are not separate?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:158",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Yes. Not separate.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:159",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“No, but…” He stops. A long silence. His eyes brim."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:160",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“...I see.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:161",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "A drop falls."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:162",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I say nothing. Nei-chan says nothing."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:163",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Time passes slowly. Felt minutes. Only a few in fact."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:164",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“...I didn’t understand.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:165",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The metronome grows louder, signaling session end."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:166",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "He bows his head quietly. “Thank you. And… I’m sorry.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:167",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan smiles small: “Mm. From here.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:168",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "---"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:169",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "A brief recollection spills from him. A mining town childhood. A hard father, strict mother. He survived by training his body and shaving his feelings. The ‘perfect separation’ in orbit was the last peace he found."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:170",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "But he knows now—"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep03/combined.en:171",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The moment when the boundary between the cup’s water and himself loosens."
    }
  ],
  "updatedAt": "2026-01-12T19:01:36+09:00"
}